{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "09WY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\textit{LC}$", "MATH_0003": "$X' \\to X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\textit{LC}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\{X' \\to X\\}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\{f_i : X_i \\to X\\}_{i\\in I}$", "MATH_0007": "$i$", "MATH_0008": "$\\{g_{ij} : X_{ij} \\to X_i\\}_{j\\in J_i}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\{X_{ij} \\to X\\}_{i \\in I, j\\in J_i}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\{X_i \\to X\\}_{i\\in I}$", "MATH_0011": "$X' \\to X$", "MATH_0012": "$\\textit{LC}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\{X' \\times_X X_i \\to X'\\}_{i\\in I}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-qc}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:305e73ca5dee65ab09a5ee54b563913b897e7cebc572669ea1b35ff2cf24b74c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8ba1370b26986842e32ee920ec3b356a1ea722abda820dabc0cb1e2db3d96839", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a Hausdorff and locally quasi-compact space, in other words,\nan object of <MATH_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0003> is an isomorphism in <MATH_0004> then\n<MATH_0005> is a qc covering.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0006> is a qc covering and for each\n<MATH_0007> we have a qc covering <MATH_0008>, then\n<MATH_0009> is a qc covering.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0010> is a qc covering\nand <MATH_0011> is a morphism of <MATH_0012> then\n<MATH_0013> is a qc covering.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2f2cd55bde2cd79edb53ff38eaab9123018c7058a5361ed4d05fa35be510f512", "unit_id": "tag:09X1:statement"}
